<title>ESTONIA: FOREKSPANK JULY PROFIT 8.1 MLN KROONS.</title>
<headline>FOREKSPANK JULY PROFIT 8.1 MLN KROONS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>July 1997</p>
<p>				   (million kroons unless stated)</p>
<p> Net profit				    8.1 vs 7.7</p>
<p> Total assets (billion kroons)	  2.26 vs 1.89</p>
<p>NOTE: Forekspank said that it will release more results</p>
<p>during the day. The results compare July 1997 with June 1997</p>
